WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:07.000
It possesses enormous power,
and brings endless pleasure

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:10.960
and destruction  to those who are destined.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.720
The Witchblade.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.880
At this moment, one woman has awakened.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:43.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:51.440
"Prisoner"

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:59.490
This means she's been captured, huh?
This doesn't look good...

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:07.200
Yes. Understood.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:09.790
Chief Nishida is on her way!

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:13.960
She wants us to give first aid
and make sure she's held down tight!

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:22.010
Wait here.
Yes, sir.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:26.560
They've made a bold move.
Will Masane-san be all right?

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:30.060
What if they lop her arm
off to get the Witchblade?

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.940
I can only hope they're that foolish.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.820
If they tried that,

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.740
the Witchblade's defensive
instincts would take care of 'em.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.450
I see...

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:49.370
Oh? The Witchblade, you say? How interesting.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:53.290
Understood. I'll call again.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.170
Takayama's luck may've just run out...

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.050
Did something happen?

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.470
Seems someone stole the Witchblade from him.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:03.680
Eh?

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.600
This is a major failure for him!

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:20.240
Guess it doesn't work...
Hey, you.

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:24.780
Have you forgotten that only
researchers can go through there?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.870
Oh, I'm new here, you see...

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:31.410
What? Is there top-secret stuff through there?

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.540
No. It's a medical research lab or something.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:37.960
They got dangerous stuff,
and do complicated surgeries and such.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.840
Medical research...

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:45.180
Yeesh. Don't they tell this
basic stuff to newcomers anymore?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.310
Hey, Mister!

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:55.600
You taking that trash to the
collection facility? I'll give you a hand!

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.160
Grandfather!

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:10.830
Maria.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.120
I came to see you! Are you happy?

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.170
Yes, it's been a while.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:21.880
Nishida went straight to
the lab to see the Witchblade.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.880
She's the same as ever.

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:27.300
She said she would say hello later.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:28.850
That's quite all right.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:33.140
Once I've finished today's duties,
I will go down there myself.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.230
Now Nishida can

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.690
I'm here, so why're you
talking only about Nishida?!

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:47.660
Maria, this is important.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.030
Whatever!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:54.790
Maria, you'd be even more
wonderful if you were more reasonable.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.370
You put your incredible IQ to shame.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:00.210
You don't like me.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.300
What a dilemma.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:07.010
Nora, take Maria somewhere lively.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:07.800
Yes, sir.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.720
No! Let go, stupid Nora!

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.760
Where's the conformant?

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:16.440
This one? She seems so ordinary...

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:22.820
She's severely injured, and her recovery
is slower than the Neo-Genes'.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:23.860
We really should treat her...

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:27.030
Take a sample of the
Witchblade and the conformant,

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:29.610
then analyze the unit itself.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.120
I've already got the information I want.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:33.540
Riko...

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.880
Rihoko-Chan, let's take your temperature.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.880
Was someone here?
Eh?

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:49.590
I get the feeling someone was
watching me this whole time...

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.180
Was it your mother?

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:56.140
No. Didn't she go home last night?

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.140
She disappeared during your checkup.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:02.730
She should've told you
if she was going to leave.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:07.990
I think it was her work.
She suddenly has to leave sometimes...

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:10.780
Oh? She's that busy?

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:16.370
Yeah. Mom's been working really hard,
ever since we came to Tokyo.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:19.710
I need to get better soon!
Yeah.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:23.000
Mom doesn't know how to cook at all!

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:32.430
This one, and this one, and this one, and...

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.720
This one's cute! How about this one?

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:40.770
Ugh! I'm not a kid anymore, Mom!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:44.770
You're still a kid in my eyes!
Ugh...

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.530
Umm...

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:04.710
We're done shopping. Take us to the hotel.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:08.000
How come?! I still haven't
bought any stuffed animals!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:12.760
I believe you've been taught not
to have such outbursts in public.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:17.350
But she took my Mr. Hippo!
You should've taken it back!

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:21.850
I will advise Nishida to refrain
from letting you outside any more.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:34.660
If you're not careful, I might lose
the ability to restrain myself.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.160
Oww!

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.620
I hate you all so much!
Let's go.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.130
I hope you die.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:59.180
Retrieving Masane-san
won't be an easy task, will it?

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:03.640
Barging into the NSWF would
cause huge problems in itself...

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:07.440
It'd be best if they
quietly handed her over to us.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.860
I can only hope that's possible...

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:17.570
This is Takayama's office. Oh, Wadou-san!

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:21.450
Has Takayama come out?
Yes, I guess...

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:26.790
I doubt he can sleep soundly,
what with the Witchblade being stolen.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:34.630
Now I know why he could never
speak clearly about the Witchblade.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.760
To think that he'd lost it...

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.720
No, that's not

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:44.640
This is a huge failure. I intend
to call an emergency board meeting.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:47.520
Pass the word on to Takayama.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:56.240
How did he find out the Witchblade was stolen?

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:00.530
A board meeting doesn't
bode well. What will you do?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.700
Give this to the lab.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.130
Eh?! Are you serious?!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:12.840
Taking back the Witchblade is top priority.

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:16.380
This is finally the end, Takayama...

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:35.570
Oh! I'm such a bad person for not
being there for you, Rihoko-Chan!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:39.780
Actually, they said it's nothing serious.
Plus, I'll be out tomorrow.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:43.160
Really? Oh, this is a love
bouquet from yours truly!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:47.120
And this is from Missy.
She's actually pretty worried, you know!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:49.830
And here's a get-well charm
from the unimpressive Naomi-bou.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.790
Thank you!

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:53.880
So, where's Masamune-Chan?!
Oh, she's at work.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.800
Eh?! You must be lonesome, Rihoko-Chan!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.300
No, I'm fine!

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:04.810
Chou-san, did my mom come home last night?

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:06.310
No...

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:10.690
An all-nighter, huh?
That must be rough, at a time like this...

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:12.190
Yeah...

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:16.650
Don't push yourself too hard, Mom...

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.710
Are things coming along?

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:32.790
Forgive me for not greeting you earlier.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.630
That's quite all right.

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:39.670
So this is the Witchblade conformant?

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:45.470
Yes. I've had a sample taken to
determine her level of conformation.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:52.100
She apparently has no memory
from before the Great Earthquake.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:57.280
She has one child, but
Why... am I... in pain?

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:03.370
How mundane. She shows
no glimpse of being a chosen one.

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:05.700
Why someone like her?

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:06.910
Doctor.

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:13.380
Father, the results of
the conformation tests are in.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.590
Aside from the obvious fact that
this woman is highly conforming...

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.210
Yes?

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.800
We re-checked the sample comparison data,

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.430
but Lady's numbers have gone down.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:27.760
I thought her numbers were exceptionally high?

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:31.020
But they've clearly lowered this time.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:32.310
You can't mean...

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:36.400
Things may have changed
between six years ago and now,

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:41.820
but it's a fact that Lady is incompatible
with the Witchblade at present.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:47.660
Very well. I have lost
some hope in Lady as of late,

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:53.370
and the fact the Witchblade chose
this woman is proof it isn't perfect.

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:59.840
Yes. The blade under development
should surpass the original.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.970
I have high hopes.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:08.850
The perfect NSWF Neo-Gene will
be the one who can wield that.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:16.900
And then I'll have
obtained the ultimate mother...

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:25.820
What? "Lady is incompatible?"
What are they talking about?

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.000
"E-mail Received"

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:42.050
"Sub: Amaha Rihoko DNA results"
"Frm: NSWF Genetics Lab"

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:54.480
"Medical Lab"

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:01.820
This's the only way inside.
Guess I got no choice...

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:04.650
Crap!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:26.260
Oh! Aren't you...

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:33.720
It is you! You're the photographer
who was with Masane-san, right?

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:39.350
Ah! So you came to rescue her, too!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.820
You're with Douji
Well, go right ahead!

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.650
Hey now, hey now!

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:48.030
It's all right!
They don't look for intruders here!

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.780
Getting out's the hard part!

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:53.330
You serious?! Then what
happens if I Can't get out?!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.250
That's what Masane-san is for!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:58.870
You dumbass! Like I can really
rely on a wounded person!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.750
You'll be just fine!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:05.840
I'll teach you a spell that'll get
her on her feet, even if she's dead!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:06.840
A spell?

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:12.050
Dammit!

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:18.020
Wow, how convenient!
Even if we fail, I can blame it on him!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.730
It's almost time...

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:44.840
Hey, she gonna be alright?

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:47.920
If she dies, she dies.

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:51.510
Poor girl...

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:58.770
It... hurts...

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:03.690
Help... me...

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:08.990
Marvelous!

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:12.410
Now if I can just analyze this data,

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:17.240
I can definitely upgrade the Cloneblades!

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:29.710
Father, very soon, our
desire will be reached...

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:35.430
Yes. I will finally approach your level...

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:39.600
You were perfect in almost every way...

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:43.230
But there is one thing
that can never be forgiven!

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:48.860
If only it weren't for that...

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.320
Masamune!

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:55.700
Whoa, this is bad...

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.410
Tozawa...

00:15:57.490 --> 00:16:02.120
Pull yourself together!
Use your power to break outta here!

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.960
I... can't move...

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:10.130
Hey, now! Rihoko's waiting!
Pull yourself together! C'mon!

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:12.920
Ri... ko...

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:15.090
That's right! Riko!

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:31.690
Take care of Riko...
Have Mariko-san and Chou-san... help...

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:32.780
Eh?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:37.870
Hey! You dumbass! This isn't funny! Masamune!

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:40.580
It's been a long while!

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.790
He has a wild smell...

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.540
Dammit!

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.670
I'll teach you a spell
that'll get her on her feet...

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:58.340
If you get outta here,
Douji'll pay you 1 0 million!

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:02.640
You listenin'?! That's 1 0 million! 1 0 million!

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:10.020
The conformant?!

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:21.280
Riko... I'll do all I can!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.080
Alright! Let's scram!

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:34.880
This can't be! She wasn't even able to move!

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:40.340
Oww...

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:43.430
This smells like a scoop!

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.730
The conformant has escaped!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:47.690
Oh?

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:00.030
Whoa.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:05.080
There's more?! No way we're gettin' out now...

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.420
Okay, that's enough!

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:26.720
Okay! Any more, and we'll open fire!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:29.100
W-What the ?!

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:34.650
Release Masane-san at once,
or Furumizu-san gets blown to pieces!

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:43.240
Oh, Director Takayama. It's been a while.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:48.450
It isn't like you to resort to such threats...

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.120
I didn't wish to draw this out.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:58.050
Had you done this at the very start,
our sisters could've avoided injury.

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:01.630
It would've been all over
for me had you pretended

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:03.220
not to have the Witchblade.

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:04.890
I see...

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:08.890
What'll it be? Will we recreate six years ago?

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.770
I think I'll pass.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.660
Masamune!

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:34.210
10 million...

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:36.960
for Riko...

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:38.590
Hey...

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:44.140
I told you the spell would work!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:53.850
Still, how did Wadou-san
find out about Masane-san?

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:00.990
There must be someone within
the section connected to Wadou...

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:05.620
Understood.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.540
Is something the matter?

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.580
The board meeting is called off!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:18.880
Damn you, Takayama... You're one lucky man...

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.600
Riko!

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:29.890
Mom!

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.930
Mom!
Riko!

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.110
Rihoko-Chan! Congratulations
on getting out of the hospital!

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:43.820
After just two nights without you,
the Natsuki Building turned bleak!

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:49.030
Thank you for visiting me!
Thank goodness you're okay!

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:53.160
Speaking of goodness,
the hospital was full of nurses

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:58.580
It's nice to see you again, Amaha-san.

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:03.670
Hold on! What's Child Welfare doing here now?!

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:07.840
I have a notice from the
Welfare Administration today.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.180
Amaha-san.

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:11.100
Test results show that you and Rihoko-Chan

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:14.520
are not genetically related.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:19.060
"DNA Paternity Test Report"

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:39.880
That can't be...

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:14.300
No! I don't like this at all!

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:16.140
I can't leave you, Mom!

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:18.020
After all, you're my mom!

00:23:18.100 --> 00:23:20.640
I hate the Child Welfare lady!

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:24.650
Why does she always try to separate us?!

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:26.230
Let's run away again.

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:28.570
To someplace nobody will follow us.

00:23:28.650 --> 00:23:31.650
And then we can build a
house and live in it together!

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:33.660
I made blueprints!

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:35.830
I'll show them to you next time, Mom!

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:37.990
We'll always be together from now on.

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:39.910
Right, Mom?
